OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial for US paratroopers
OL,4,Akilled in RAF blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial has been unveiled to honour
OL,7,Fthree US paratroopers killed in an
OL,8,Faccident at an RAF base in Lincolnshire
OL,9,Fduring World War Two.
OL,11,FStaff Sgt Robert Shearer, PFC William
OL,12,FMitchell and Pte Louis Spera died at
OL,13,FRAF Fulbeck in September 1944 when 10
OL,14,Flandmines being transported on the back
OL,15,Fof a truck exploded.
OL,17,FUnveiling the memorial earlier during a
OL,18,Fceremony at the former airbase, near
OL,19,FNewark, Gail Tesei, Pte Spera's nephew,
OL,20,Fdescribed the event as "amazing".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
